  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Catalysing Private Sector Investment in Renewable Energy (Solar Minigrids)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project, through UNDP will catalyse a shift from supporting large-scale infrastructure to private sector-led solar minigrid development, aligned with Zimbabwe&#x2019;s emerging minigrid policy framework. It will establish a de-risking facility to reduce investment barriers for private developers and provide targeted incentives to attract private investment such as supporting women-led enterprises as part of the anchor demand support. This approach represents a shift  from a donor to an investor. It is also contributing to one of our Country Business Plan (CBP) objectives to responsibly exit from large scale service delivery into systems strengthening. Private sector participation in the growth of the renewable sector is widely recognised as very sustainable.</narrative>
  </description>
